}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0 {\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 \'95 Service Structure: You decide to break down the application into several smaller services:\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0 {\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2   1. User Service\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0 {\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2   2. Order Service\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0 {\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2   3. Restaurant Service\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0 {\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2   4. Payment Service\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0 {\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2   5. Notification Service\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0 {\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2   6. Review Service\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0 {\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2   7. Delivery Tracking Service\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s1\li540\fi-540\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0\qc {\b\shad\f1\fs48\cf1 Finding the Right Balance: Micro vs Macro Services\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f6\fs44 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf6\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2 Define clear service boundaries:}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2  Group functionality by business capability; each service should own a cohesive domain.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f6\fs44 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf6\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2 Apply Domain-Driven Design:}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2  Use bounded contexts to make services meaningful, decoupled, and aligned with domain logic.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f6\fs44 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf6\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2 Align with organization:}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2  Map services to team ownership so teams can iterate independently and take responsibility.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f6\fs44 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf6\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2 Right-size services:}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2  Avoid trivial single-endpoint services and }{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2 monoliths ;  }{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2 choose a scope that keeps complexity low and value high.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f6\fs44 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf6\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2 Enforce strong interfaces:}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2  Stable, well-documented APIs (contracts, versioning) reduce coupling and make evolution safe.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f4\fs44 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'95}}{\i\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2 Contract:}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2  Order Service exposes }{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\cf2 POST /v1/orders}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2  and }{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\cf2 GET /v1/orders/\'7bid\'7d}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2  with a documented JSON schema; changes require version bump.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f6\fs44 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf6\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2 Rule of thumb:}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2  prefer smaller services when you need independent deploys and clear ownership; prefer larger (macro) services when cross-service coordination or latency dominates.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s1\li540\fi-540\loch\af4\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0\qc {\b\shad\f1\fs56\cf1 End Chapter\par 
}
